            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Blood Scent"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A mandragora can smell creatures with blood as an imprecise sense at a range of 30 feet, and it can smell demons, fey, and sorcerers with blood as a precise sense at a range of 30 feet."
